      "created_at": "2014-01-16T06:16:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Last I played was Diamond, fairly briefly. And I don't have a 3DS. :(</p><p>Had a great time with the older titles though (started with the original Red/Blue way back when). I remember totally confusing a random child by making \"So which starter did you choose? I went for Charmander because I wanted more of a challenge in the first couple of gyms,\" type conversation when I heard him encountering a wild pokémon. He was obviously not expecting a 20-something female to play or know anything about the game, so I like to think I challenged his stereotypes a little.</p>",
